sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client<br/>(via Gateway/HTTPRoute)
    participant KRP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant App as Upstream Application<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (localhost)
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>(openshift-monitoring)
    participant OIDC as OIDC Identity Provider<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,App: Flow 1: Bearer Token Authentication

    Client->>KRP: HTTPS/8443 POST /api/resource<br/>Authorization: Bearer <token><br/>TLS 1.2+
    KRP->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/443 POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token (in-cluster)
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: TokenReview response<br/>(authenticated user info, groups)
    KRP->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/443 POST /apis/authorization.k8s.io/v1/subjectaccessreviews<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token (in-cluster)
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: SubjectAccessReview response<br/>(allowed: true/false)
    alt Authorized
        KRP->>App: HTTP/8080 POST /api/resource<br/>x-remote-user: <username><br/>x-remote-groups: <groups><br/>No encryption (localhost)
        App-->>KRP: HTTP 200 Response
        KRP-->>Client: HTTPS 200 Response<br/>TLS 1.2+
    else Denied
        KRP-->>Client: HTTPS 403 Forbidden<br/>TLS 1.2+
    end

    Note over Client,App: Flow 2: Client TLS Certificate Authentication

    Client->>KRP: HTTPS/8443 POST /api/resource<br/>mTLS (client cert signed by --client-ca-file CA)<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Note right of KRP: Extract identity from<br/>certificate CommonName
    KRP->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/443 POST SubjectAccessReview<br/>user: <cert CN>, groups: <cert orgs>
    K8sAPI-->>KRP: SubjectAccessReview response
    alt Authorized
        KRP->>App: HTTP/8080 POST /api/resource<br/>x-remote-user: <CN><br/>No encryption (localhost)
        App-->>KRP: HTTP 200 Response
        KRP-->>Client: HTTPS 200 Response
    else Denied
        KRP-->>Client: HTTPS 403 Forbidden
    end

    Note over Prom,App: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping (Hardcoded Prometheus Authorization)

    Prom->>KRP: HTTPS/8443 GET /metrics<br/>Authorization: Bearer <prometheus-sa-token><br/>TLS 1.2+
    Note right of KRP: Hardcoded check:<br/>SA = system:serviceaccount:<br/>openshift-monitoring:prometheus-k8s<br/>+ GET /metrics → ALLOW
    KRP->>App: HTTP/8080 GET /metrics<br/>No encryption (localhost)
    App-->>KRP: HTTP 200 (metrics payload)
    KRP-->>Prom: HTTPS 200 (metrics payload)<br/>TLS 1.2+
